<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta
			name="viewport"
			content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no"
		/>

		<title>AI in Science – MPE Discussion 2026</title>

		<link rel="stylesheet" href="dist/reset.css" />
		<link rel="stylesheet" href="dist/reveal.css" />
		<link rel="stylesheet" href="dist/theme/simple.css" />

		<!-- Theme used for syntax highlighted code -->
		<link rel="stylesheet" href="dist/plugin/highlight/monokai.css" />

		<style>
			/* 2D poll table styles */
			.poll-wrap table {
				font-size: 0.75em;
				border: none;
				width: auto;
				margin: 0 auto;
			}
			.poll-wrap table td {
				border: none;
				padding: 2px 4px;
				background: transparent;
			}
			.rotate-cell {
				width: 1.2em;
				overflow: hidden;
			}
			.rotate-cell > div {
				display: inline-block;
				white-space: nowrap;
				writing-mode: vertical-rl;
				transform: rotate(180deg);
			}
			td.pollbox {
				width: 260px;
				height: 260px;
				padding: 0 !important;
				border: none !important;
			}
			td.pollbox iframe {
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				border: 1px solid #888;
				display: block;
				background: #fff;
			}

			/* QR code top-right corner */
			.qr-corner {
				position: absolute;
				top: 0px;
				right: 8px;
				width: 20%;
				height: 20%;
				z-index: 100;
			}
			.qr-corner img {
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				display: block;
			}

			/* HOW DO YOU USE AI six-column table */
			.use-table {
				font-size: 0.48em;
				border-collapse: collapse;
				width: 100%;
				table-layout: fixed;
			}
			.quad-table {
				font-size: 0.7em;
			}
			.use-table th,
			.use-table td {
				border: 0;
				padding: 3px 4px;
				text-align: left;
				vertical-align: middle;
				word-wrap: break-word;
			}
			.use-table td.col-pixel {
				text-align: center;
				padding: 0 !important;
				width: 100px;
				min-width: 100px;
				height: 60px;
			}
			.use-table td.col-q {
				text-align: center;
				padding: 0 !important;
				width: 2em;
			}
			.use-table td.col-pixel iframe {
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				min-width: 100px;
				min-height: 160px;
				display: block;
				border: 1px solid #555;
				background: #fff;
			}
			.use-table td strong {
				font-size: 1.0em;
				display: block;
				margin-bottom: 0.2em;
				max-width: 12ch;
				word-break: break-word;
			}
			.use-table td span.sub-text {
				font-size: 0.5em;
				display: block;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="reveal">
			<div class="slides">

				<!-- Slide 1: AI taking over? -->
				<section>
					<h2>AI &amp; our scientific work</h2>
					Interactive Discussion 
					<img src="qr.svg" alt="QR code" style="max-width:50%; max-height:50%" />
				</section>

				<!-- Slide 1: AI taking over? -->
				<section>
					<div class="qr-corner"><img src="qr.svg" alt="QR code" /></div>
					<h2>AI taking over?</h2>
					<ul>
						<li>Self-driving cars – but are humans that good at driving?</li>
						<li>Mathematics</li>
						<li>50% of astro papers co-written with AI support, &lt;1% declare it <em style="color:gray">arxiv:2609.10664</em></li>
						<li>Fear, uncertainty and doubt</li>
						<hr/>
						<li>AI is not everything and AI is not nothing</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<!-- Slide 2: Terminology -->
				<section>
					<div class="qr-corner"><img src="qr.svg" alt="QR code" /></div>
					<h2>Terminology</h2>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>A</strong>rtificial <strong>I</strong>ntelligence: computers capable of learning, reasoning, problem-solving, perception, and decision-making</li>
						<li><strong>M</strong>achine <strong>L</strong>earning: data-driven model ability</li>
						<li><strong>L</strong>arge <strong>L</strong>anguage <strong>M</strong>odels</li>
						<li><strong>G</strong>enerative <strong>P</strong>re-trained <strong>T</strong>ransformers</li>
						<li><em>Slop</em>: Garbage output</li>
						<li><em>Meat proxy</em>: using without thinking</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<!-- Slide 3: Using AI -->
				<section>
					<div class="qr-corner"><img src="qr.svg" alt="QR code" /></div>
					<h2>Using AI</h2>
					<ul>
						<li>Computers</li>
						<li>"Interpolator" of some training data</li>
						<li>Model improves its capacity with data fed into it</li>
						<li>Areas:
							<ul>
								<li>Large homogeneous surveys (spectra, images, sims)</li>
								<li>Accelerating physics models (emulators: spectral emulators)</li>
								<li>Doing research (programming, writing, idea generation, automating) – Large Language Models</li>
							</ul>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</section>


				<!-- Slide 5: 2D Interactive Poll -->
				<section>
					<div class="qr-corner"><img src="qr.svg" alt="QR code" /></div>
					<h2 style="font-size:0.85em;">Live Poll – Usage &amp; Mood</h2>
					<div class="poll-wrap">
						<table>
							<tr>
								<td></td>
								<td></td>
								<td colspan="2"><strong>How often do you use AI?</strong></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td></td>
								<td></td>
								<td align="left">never</td>
								<td align="right">daily</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td rowspan="2" class="rotate-cell"><div><strong>How do you feel about AI?</strong></div></td>
								<td style="vertical-align:top">relaxed</td>
								<td rowspan="2" colspan="2" class="pollbox">
									<iframe src="pixelpress2d.php?id=usage_mood" scrolling="no"></iframe>
								</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td style="vertical-align:bottom">anxious</td>
							</tr>
						</table>
					</div>
				</section>
				<section>
					<div class="qr-corner"><img src="qr.svg" alt="QR code" /></div>
					<h2>Live Poll – Usage &amp; Mood</h2>
					<div class="poll-wrap">

						<div style="margin-top: 0.1em;">
							<table>
								<tr>
									<td></td>
									<td></td>
									<td colspan="2"><strong>How useful do you find AI for your work?</strong></td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td></td>
									<td></td>
									<td align="left">not useful</td>
									<td align="right">very useful</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td rowspan="2" class="rotate-cell"><div><strong>Ethical concerns?</strong></div></td>
									<td style="vertical-align:top">none</td>
									<td rowspan="2" colspan="2">
										<iframe src="pixelpress2d.php?id=useful_ethics" scrolling="no"></iframe>
									</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="vertical-align:bottom">strong</td>
								</tr>
							</table>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<!-- Slide 4: HOW DO YOU USE AI? – six-column table -->
				<section>
					<div class="qr-corner"><img src="qr.svg" alt="QR code" /></div>
					<h2 style="font-size:0.75em; margin-bottom: 0.3em;">HOW DO YOU USE AI?</h2>
					<table class="use-table">
						<tbody>
							<tr>
								<td class="col-q"><strong>Demo</strong><span class="sub-text">Demonstration iframe example</span></td>
								<td class="col-pixel">
									<table class="quad-table">
										<tr>
											<td></td>
											<td></td>
											<td colspan="2">How useful do you find AI for your work?</td>
										</tr>
										<tr>
											<td></td>
											<td></td>
											<td align="left">not useful</td>
											<td align="right">very useful</td>
										</tr>
										<tr>
											<td rowspan="2" class="rotate-cell"><div>Ethical concerns?</div></td>
											<td style="vertical-align:top">none</td>
											<td rowspan="2" colspan="2">
												<iframe src="pixelpress2d.php?id=useful_ethics" scrolling="no"></iframe>
											</td>
										</tr>
										<tr>
											<td style="vertical-align:bottom">strong</td>
										</tr>
									</table>
								</td>
								<td class="col-q"><strong>Data reduction</strong><span class="sub-text">Artifact rejection, classification</span></td>
								<td class="col-pixel">
									<iframe src="pixelpress2d.php?id=reduction_" scrolling="no"></iframe>
								</td>
								<td class="col-q"><strong>Literature search</strong><span class="sub-text">Arxiv sorting, ADS similar papers</span></td>
								<td class="col-pixel">
									<iframe src="pixelpress2d.php?id=literature_" scrolling="no"></iframe>
								</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="col-q"><strong>Reading</strong><span class="sub-text">Ask LLM for summaries, clarification</span></td>
								<td class="col-pixel">
									<iframe src="pixelpress2d.php?id=reading_" scrolling="no"></iframe>
								</td>
								<td class="col-q"><strong>Programming</strong><span class="sub-text">Analysis code generation, debugging</span></td>
								<td class="col-pixel">
									<iframe src="pixelpress2d.php?id=programming_" scrolling="no"></iframe>
								</td>
								<td class="col-q"><strong>Data analysis</strong><span class="sub-text">Accelerating inference with emulators, SBI</span></td>
								<td class="col-pixel">
									<iframe src="pixelpress2d.php?id=analysis_" scrolling="no"></iframe>
								</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="col-q"><strong>Writing papers &amp; proposals</strong><span class="sub-text">Grammar rephrasing, initial draft from code</span></td>
								<td class="col-pixel">
									<iframe src="pixelpress2d.php?id=writing_" scrolling="no"></iframe>
								</td>
								<td class="col-q"><strong>Reviewing</strong><span class="sub-text">Identify problems in other people's papers</span></td>
								<td class="col-pixel">
									<iframe src="pixelpress2d.php?id=reviewing_" scrolling="no"></iframe>
								</td>
								<td class="col-q"><strong>Autonomous research</strong><span class="sub-text">Agents doing end-to-end research</span></td>
								<td class="col-pixel">
									<iframe src="pixelpress2d.php?id=agents_" scrolling="no"></iframe>
								</td>
							</tr>
						</tbody>
					</table>
				</section>

			</div>
		</div>

		<script src="dist/reveal.js"></script>
		<script src="dist/plugin/notes.js"></script>
		<script src="dist/plugin/markdown.js"></script>
		<script src="dist/plugin/highlight.js"></script>
		<script>
			Reveal.initialize({
				hash: true,
				plugins: [RevealMarkdown, RevealHighlight, RevealNotes],
			});
		</script>
	</body>
</html>
